# Product scope — Security+ public landing

Be Certified Today’s public home (`/` / `index.html`) redirects to **CompTIA Security+ SY0-701** (`/comptia-sec+-home.html`). CCNA and CCNP ENCOR are not shown on the public chooser while Sec+ ads run; portal pages remain for existing access.

## Do

- Keep `/` and `/index.html` redirecting to `/comptia-sec+-home.html`.
- Implement Sec+ practice/PBQ/portal/ads under **`public/COMP_TIA_SEC+/`**, **`public/comptia-sec+-home.html`**, and Sec+ campaign docs.
- Preserve CCNA/ENCOR portal homes, magic-link restore, and admin reporting (do not delete track files).
- Follow `.cursor/rules/secplus-pbq-dragdrop-pages.mdc` and `.cursor/rules/question-bank-template.mdc` for Sec+ banks.
- Point guest brand/home links to `/comptia-sec+-home.html`, not the multi-track chooser.

## Do not (unless the user explicitly asks)

- Restore the three-track chooser on `/`.
- Make CCNA/ENCOR the default public landing or paid Search focus.
- Delete CCNA/ENCOR portal or restore-access flows.

When adding a **new** cert track or launching a CCNA paid campaign, wait for an explicit user request.
